# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages response headers.
# Ignored by GitHub Pages, which does not support custom headers.
#
# X-Robots-Tag is enforced by crawlers more reliably than robots.txt, because
# robots.txt is only a request and does not stop a page being listed when it is
# linked from elsewhere. Applied to the PDFs only — the portfolio pages
# themselves are meant to be findable.

/*.pdf
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, noarchive, nosnippet
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
